⍝ 08 · Conway's Game of Life, the famous one-line APL version
⍝ Run:  dyalog sample-scripts/08-life.apls

⍝ A cell lives next turn if it has 3 live neighbours, or 2 and is alive.
⍝ ⊖ and ⌽ shift the board in every direction to count neighbours.
Life←{⊃1 ⍵∨.∧3 4=+/,¯1 0 1∘.⊖¯1 0 1∘.⌽⊂⍵}
Show←{↓' █'[1+⍵]}

board←8 8⍴0
board[2;3]←1 ⋄ board[3;4]←1 ⋄ board[4;2 3 4]←1   ⍝ a glider
:For gen :In ⍳4
    ⎕←'generation ',⍕gen
    ⎕←↑Show board
    board←Life board
:EndFor
